# A wizinvis immortal shuts the game down. As wiz-shutdown, but Smokegod (60) types wizinvis first: no echo goes
# to anyone, every connection closes, and shutdown.txt still says who. do_shutdown's first "if (ch->invis_level <
# LEVEL_HERO)" had no braces and guarded only the sprintf, so for a wizinvis immortal append_file and strcat used
# a buffer nothing had filled (#16): shutdown.txt got garbage or nothing, and stock's startup script, finding no
# shutdown.txt, restarted the game.
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
wizinvis
shutdown
@file shutdown.txt
